# Template only. Do not fill this in by hand and never commit the real file.
# `plow-agents mint LINE_UID` (or `plow-agents deploy --local --line LINE_UID`)
# writes ./plow-credentials with the real values; .gitignore and .dockerignore keep it
# out of Git and out of the image.
#
# PLOW_API_BASE=https://<plow api root, no /v1>
# PLOW_AGENT_TOKEN=<minted per line; secret>
#
# AGENT_ID is already baked into the Dockerfile (casey-csm). Only set it here if you
# are testing under a different slug.
